Obsidian AMaps
==============

This project is a fork of the Obsidian Maps plugin by Obsidian.
Original repository: https://github.com/obsidianmd/obsidian-maps

Copyright (c) 2025 Obsidian
Copyright (c) 2025 Easman (modifications)

Modifications from Original
---------------------------

Version 1.0.0:
  * Replaced MapLibre GL JS with AMap (Gaode Maps) JS API 2.0
  * Added AMap API Key and Security Configuration support
  * Optimized for users in China mainland with faster map loading
  * Implemented WGS-84 to GCJ-02 coordinate conversion
  * Replaced GeoJSON-based markers with AMap.Marker
  * Replaced MapLibre Popup with AMap.InfoWindow
  * Removed multi-tile provider support (AMap only)
  * Removed RTL (Right-to-Left) text plugin
  * Updated test data to use Chinese locations
  * Added bilingual documentation (English and Chinese)

Third-Party Dependencies
------------------------

This project uses the following third-party libraries:

  * @amap/amap-jsapi-loader - AMap JavaScript API Loader
    https://www.npmjs.com/package/@amap/amap-jsapi-loader

  * obsidian - Obsidian API
    https://github.com/obsidianmd/obsidian-api

